# The skill that makes Chance Attack conditional, and the only thing in the
# game that scars a monster. GMS calls it piercing the enemy; the word here is
# taken from the sword, a pierce already being what an arrow does to a row of
# them.
#
# GMS runs it for 80 + 6*L seconds off an MP cost, with nothing stopping the
# player putting it straight back up -- so it simply stands, as every other
# buff of that shape does. What is bought with the levels is the chance a line
# scars what it lands on, which reaches certainty at master level.
#
# Its accuracy half is dropped: this game has no accuracy to lose. What is
# left is the attack power, which is a barrier like any other and sums with
# the rest of what the character carries -- see SkillEffect.enemy_attack_pct.
name: "Scarring Sword"
description:
  "Infuses the sword with spirit, which leaves an indelible scar on the "
  "enemy, weakening its attacks."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CRUSADER skill_order: 5 }
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_SWORD
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_ONE_HANDED_AXE
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_TWO_HANDED_AXE
base {
  scar_chance: 0.43
  scar_seconds: 20.0
  enemy_attack_pct_when_scarred: 0.11
}
per_level {
  scar_chance: 0.03
  enemy_attack_pct_when_scarred: 0.01
}
